{"pin":"AB00362","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00362","anchor":"","first_line":"O ye friends of the East and the West! Among the foundations of the religion of God, the inner significances of the Word of God, and the duties of the friends of God... O God, my God! Illumine the brows of Thy true lovers… The foundation of life and existence is cooperation and mutual aid, whereas the cause of annihilation and deterioration is the cessation of aid and assistance","first_line_orig":"ای یاران شرق و غرب از اعظم اساس دین الله و معانی کلمه الله و تکلیف احباء الله  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"630","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AMK.057-058","source":"AMK","locator":"057-058"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.261.19x","source":"AVK3","locator":"261.19x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK3/ak3-265.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"COMP_MASHRIQP#22x","source":"COMP_MASHRIQP","locator":"22x","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/originals_mashriq_compilation.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MJMJ2.030ax","source":"MJMJ2","locator":"030ax","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMA2/mma2-31.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT4.128","source":"MKT4","locator":"128","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA4/ma4-128.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMG2#327 p.365x","source":"MMG2","locator":"327 p.365x","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMA/mma-368.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#235 p.306x","source":"MMK1","locator":"235 p.306x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/321610749"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MNMK#084 p.152x","source":"MNMK","lo